### Data Residency

#### EU Data Requirements

| Requirement | Implementation |
|-------------|----------------|
| GDPR Compliance | Full compliance required |
| Data Location | EU-based data centers |
| Data Transfer | No transfer to US without consent |
| Right to Erasure | Automated deletion workflows |
| Data Portability | Export functionality |
| DPO | Designated for EU operations |

#### Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    Global Infrastructure                    │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐        │
│  │   US-West   │  │   US-East   │  │  EU-West    │        │
│  │   (prod)    │  │    (DR)     │  │  (new)      │        │
│  └─────────────┘  └─────────────┘  └─────────────┘        │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                    Customer Data Rules                      │
│  - US Customers: US regions only                           │
│  - EU Customers: EU region only (no US)                    │
│  - Cross-region: Metadata only                             │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

#### EU Region Setup

| Component | Provider | Location |
|-----------|----------|----------|
| Compute | AWS | eu-west-2 (London) |
| Database | AWS RDS | eu-west-2 |
| Storage | AWS S3 | eu-west-2 |
| CDN | CloudFront | EU edge locations |
| Backup | AWS | eu-west-1 (Ireland) |

